{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Every user-facing screen, dialog and player state a bundled theme must draw (PLAN 9.45, docs/themes/PIPELINE.md). theme_walk.py visits them in order. Placeholders: {sid}, {user}, {view:<collectionType>} (a library; 'mixed' for one without a type), {item:<ItemType>}, {person}, {genre}, {musicgenre}, {studio}, {artist}, {channel}. Placeholders are filled from the user's own library on the workstation (host.py); an entry with nothing to fill it is skipped and says so. Nothing is saved, created or deleted: dialogs are opened and closed, Delete is never opened. target: 'theme' (the theme draws it: D30, no jellyfin-web left) or 'dashboard' (stays jellyfin-web's own). needs: 'music' or 'video' (something playing first).",
  "screens": [
    {"id": "home", "group": "Home", "name": "Home", "hash": "#/home"},
    {"id": "home-favourites", "group": "Home", "name": "Home: Favourites tab", "hash": "#/home?tab=1"},
    {"id": "search", "group": "Home", "name": "Search", "hash": "#/search"},

    {"id": "lib-movies", "group": "Libraries", "name": "Movies", "hash": "#/movies?topParentId={view:movies}&collectionType=movies&serverId={sid}"},
